on exitFrame
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <"hitback">
  [  2] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  5] set 0 ................................... set the keyDownScript to "hitback"
  [  7] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [ 10] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 13] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <7, 1>
  [ 15] extcall 15 .............................. puppetSprite(7, 1)
  [ 17] ret
end
